  "findings": [
    "REJECTED: call_function returns events but eval_function_call discards them and inline expansion filters to Plain. checker_return_function_theme_event loses the executed cerulean theme in identity and shipped SVG. Java TContext.executeLines/executeTheme appends it to resultList even during return-function evaluation.",
